//! Expensive, explicit integration qualification using actual proofs and Bitcoin.
//!
//! No fixture-origin import or proof oracle is available here. Every signer share
//! is generated by BootstrapAllocate. The in-process transport roundtrips the
//! shared wire and reopens the actual durable Engine on every request; TLS has a
//! separate integration test. Set ZARK_REAL_FLOW_CONFIG to a locally authenticated
//! JSON config containing manifest/program/tool paths and SHA256 pins, then run:
//! cargo test --test zark_flow_real fresh_bootstrap_alice_bob_carol_and_cooperative_exit -- --ignored --exact --nocapture --test-threads=1
//! The separate CLI/TLS test also requires explicit wallet/signer binary pins.
//!
//! This always creates a new private run directory and isolated no-peer regtest
//! node. A failed run is retained for diagnosis, never treated as a successful
//! deployment or automatically imported into a subsequent run.
